<div class="featureddoc"><a href="index4284.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1328&amp;Itemid=1142&amp;lang=en"><img src="images/stories/about_tsunamis/tsunami_glossary/tsunami_glossary_2013_thumbnail.jpg" alt="tsunami glossary 2013 thumbnail" width="78" height="102" style="border: thin solid #000000;" border="0" /></a> <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><a href="index4284.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1328&amp;Itemid=1142&amp;lang=en"><br /><strong>Tsunami Glossary 2019</strong></a><br />
<p>Available in English, Arabic, Spanish, French, Bahasa, Chinese.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="featureddoc"><a href="index971c.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1333&amp;Itemid=2313"><img src="images/stories/awareness_and_education/surviving_a_tsunami/Thumbnail_surviving.png" alt="Thumbnail surviving" width="88" height="68" style="border: thin solid #000000;" /></a><a href="index90f6.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1678&amp;Itemid=1075&amp;lang=en"><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></a><br /><br /><a href="index971c.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1333&amp;Itemid=2313"><strong>Surviving a Tsunami - Lessons from Chile, Hawaii, and Japan</strong><br /></a>Available in English, Spanish.</div>
<div class="featureddoc"><a href="index90f6.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1678&amp;Itemid=1075&amp;lang=en"><img src="images/stories/where_the_first_wave_arrives_in_minutes_thumbnail_12.06.10.jpg" alt="great_waves_en_feb09_thumbnail" width="96" height="68" style="border: #000000 thin solid;" border="0" /></a><a href="index90f6.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1678&amp;Itemid=1075&amp;lang=en"><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></a><br /><br /><a href="index90f6.html?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=1678&amp;Itemid=1075&amp;lang=en"><strong>Where the First Wave Arrives in Minutes</strong><br /></a>Available in English, Bahasa, Spanish, French.</div>
